{"id":"caa08499-feb7-4ba5-a00f-5383e3318a7b","slug":"ig3500","model":"IG3500","name":"IG3500 余氯分析仪","shortDescription":"采用DPD比色法监测水中余氯，面向供水及工业过程。结合光学干扰补偿、自动清洗与数据存储，提供继电器控制输出，并可选远传模块接入监测系统。","featured":false,"category":{"slug":"water","brand":null,"name":"水质分析","description":null,"seo":{"title":"水质分析","description":null,"imageUrl":null,"index":true}},"heroImage":{"id":"c50c4c9d-55bb-4423-8c3e-781ffff460bb","kind":"IMAGE","originalName":"2025040937453857.jpg","mimeType":"image/png","size":161037,"sha256":"8851b0c528aa8f3f11bac4d54c4a5ffd8e6ba0b79e7a6a527d4c31805dbb2c25","width":439,"height":577,"url":"/igenu-preview/media/8851b0c528aa8f3f11bac4d5.png","createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:32:39.818Z","variants":[{"width":320,"height":421,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/a94dedbc4c305ed00e17532e.webp"},{"width":439,"height":577,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/addc2737c9f6397359f3a546.webp"}]},"detailLayout":"STRUCTURED","availableLocales":["de","zh-CN","en"],"description":null,"bodyHtml":"<p><strong><span>产品特点：</span></strong></p><p>◆DPD标准比色法 </p><p>◆长光程光路结构，不易污染，吸光度检测分辨率可大于0.001Abs </p><p>◆双光速技术，自动对浊度、色度、气泡干扰补偿 </p><p>◆独特的流体结构，维护要求低 </p><p>◆继电器输出，可锁定加氯泵，实现自动加氯 </p><p>◆可选配4G远传模块，数据无线上传</p><p>◆自带存储功能，方便查看记录</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>应用领域：</span></strong></p><p>市政自来水 、管网监测 、食品饮料 、饮用及地表水监测、工业过程</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>技术参数：</span></strong></p><p>量程：0~10mg/L </p><p>测量原理：DPD比色法 </p><p>测量精度：测量值的±1%或0.01mg/L，取大值 </p><p>检测下限：0.01mg/L </p><p>测量模式：连续测量，周期测量（测量间隔可调）</p><p>显示： 70mm×48 mm 液晶显示 </p><p>校准：默认校正曲线 </p><p>试剂余量报警：有 </p><p>数据存储：历史记录 </p><p>自动清洗功能：有 </p><p>试剂更换周期：1个月（以5分钟测量计）</p><p>通讯：RS485MODBUS </p><p>输出：4-20mA </p><p>继电器：2路，可设置报警 </p><p>电源：220-230VAC，50/60Hz</p><p>样品流速：250-500mL/min </p><p>样品进口压力：0.1~5bar </p><p>样品温度：5~45℃ </p><p>工作环境：5-95%，不凝结 </p><p>仪器尺寸：350mm*186mm*460mm(长*宽*高）</p><p>重量：9kg </p><p>安装方式：壁挂</p><br />\n    ","gallery":[],"features":[],"specificationGroups":[{"name":"技术参数","specifications":[{"key":"measurement-range","label":"量程","value":"0~10mg/L","unit":null},{"key":"measurement-principle","label":"测量原理","value":"DPD比色法","unit":null},{"key":"accuracy","label":"测量精度","value":"测量值的±1%或0.01mg/L，取大值","unit":null},{"key":"detection-limit","label":"检测下限","value":"0.01mg/L","unit":null},{"key":"measurement-mode","label":"测量模式","value":"连续测量，周期测量（测量间隔可调）","unit":null},{"key":"display","label":"显示","value":"70mm×48 mm 液晶显示","unit":null},{"key":"calibration","label":"校准","value":"默认校正曲线","unit":null},{"key":"reagent-alarm","label":"试剂余量报警","value":"有","unit":null},{"key":"data-storage","label":"数据存储","value":"历史记录","unit":null},{"key":"automatic-cleaning","label":"自动清洗功能","value":"有","unit":null},{"key":"reagent-replacement","label":"试剂更换周期","value":"1个月（以5分钟测量计）","unit":null},{"key":"digital-communication","label":"通讯","value":"RS485MODBUS","unit":null},{"key":"output","label":"输出","value":"4-20mA","unit":null},{"key":"relay","label":"继电器","value":"2路，可设置报警","unit":null},{"key":"power-supply","label":"电源","value":"220-230VAC，50/60Hz","unit":null},{"key":"sample-flow","label":"样品流速","value":"250-500mL/min","unit":null},{"key":"sample-pressure","label":"样品进口压力","value":"0.1~5bar","unit":null},{"key":"sample-temperature","label":"样品温度","value":"5~45℃","unit":null},{"key":"operating-temperature","label":"工作环境","value":"5-95%，不凝结","unit":null},{"key":"instrument-size","label":"仪器尺寸","value":"350mm*186mm*460mm(长*宽*高）","unit":null},{"key":"weight","label":"重量","value":"9kg","unit":null},{"key":"installation","label":"安装方式","value":"壁挂","unit":null}]}],"sourceReviews":[],"documents":[],"supportDownloads":[],"seo":{"title":"IG3500 余氯分析仪 | IGENU SCIENCE","description":"采用DPD比色法监测水中余氯，面向供水及工业过程。结合光学干扰补偿、自动清洗与数据存储，提供继电器控制输出，并可选远传模块接入监测系统。","imageUrl":"/igenu-preview/media/8851b0c528aa8f3f11bac4d5.png","index":true}}